---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About | Muhammad Atif"
  description="About Muhammad Atif — Senior Software Engineer specializing in enterprise software, Microsoft 365, SharePoint, Power Platform, cloud, and AI."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-16">
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-400">
        About Me
      </p>

      <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-100 md:text-5xl">
  Senior Software Engineer focused on enterprise platforms, modernization, and AI
</h1>

<p class="mt-6 text-xl leading-8 text-slate-300">
  I am a senior software engineer with 18+ years of experience designing,
  developing, modernizing, and supporting enterprise technology solutions
  across .NET, Microsoft 365, SharePoint, Power Platform, cloud platforms,
  and AI-powered applications.
</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-14 grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-3">
      <article class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-700 bg-slate-900/60 p-7 shadow-sm">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100">
          Enterprise Engineering
        </h2>

        <p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-slate-300">
  Building enterprise applications, backend services, APIs, integrations,
  and distributed solutions using C#, .NET, ASP.NET Core, SQL Server, and
  modern application architecture.
</p>
      </article>

      <article class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-700 bg-slate-900/60 p-7 shadow-sm">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100">
          Microsoft Platforms
        </h2>

        <p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-slate-300">
  Designing and modernizing Microsoft 365 solutions across SharePoint,
  SharePoint Online, SPFx, Power Apps, Power Automate, Microsoft Graph,
  and enterprise migration programs.
</p>
      </article>

      <article class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-700 bg-slate-900/60 p-7 shadow-sm">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100">
          AI Engineering
        </h2>

        <p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-slate-300">
  Applying software engineering principles to enterprise AI through LLM
  applications, RAG pipelines, vector search, retrieval quality,
  prompt engineering, evaluation, and intelligent automation.
</p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-16 grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2">
      <div>
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-400">
          Engineering Philosophy
        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-100">
          Solve the problem, not just the technology
        </h2>

        <div class="mt-6 space-y-5 leading-7 text-slate-300">
  <p>
    I approach software engineering from both a technical and business
    perspective. Solutions should be scalable, maintainable, secure, and
    aligned with the organization's actual processes and objectives.
  </p>

  <p>
    My experience across application development, enterprise platforms,
    SharePoint, Microsoft 365, cloud infrastructure, migrations, and
    automation allows me to work across the full lifecycle — from architecture
    and technical design through implementation, modernization, and delivery.
  </p>

  <p>
    I apply the same engineering discipline to AI systems, with particular
    attention to architecture, data and retrieval quality, grounding,
    evaluation, security, and reliable integration into real business
    workflows.
  </p>
</div>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-700 bg-slate-900/60 p-8">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-400">
          Core Technologies
        </p>

        <div class="mt-6 space-y-6">
  <div>
    <p class="mb-3 text-sm font-medium text-slate-300">
      Backend & APIs
    </p>

    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
      <span class="skill-tag">C#</span>
      <span class="skill-tag">.NET</span>
      <span class="skill-tag">ASP.NET Core</span>
      <span class="skill-tag">REST APIs</span>
      <span class="skill-tag">SQL Server</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div>
    <p class="mb-3 text-sm font-medium text-slate-300">
      Microsoft 365 & Power Platform
    </p>

    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
      <span class="skill-tag">SharePoint</span>
      <span class="skill-tag">SharePoint Online</span>
      <span class="skill-tag">SPFx</span>
      <span class="skill-tag">React</span>
      <span class="skill-tag">TypeScript</span>
      <span class="skill-tag">Power Apps</span>
      <span class="skill-tag">Power Automate</span>
      <span class="skill-tag">Microsoft 365</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div>
    <p class="mb-3 text-sm font-medium text-slate-300">
      Cloud & Engineering
    </p>

    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
      <span class="skill-tag">Azure</span>
      <span class="skill-tag">PowerShell</span>
      <span class="skill-tag">Python</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div>
    <p class="mb-3 text-sm font-medium text-slate-300">
      AI & Data
    </p>

    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
      <span class="skill-tag">LLMs</span>
      <span class="skill-tag">RAG</span>
      <span class="skill-tag">Vector Search</span>
      <span class="skill-tag">AI Automation</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-16 rounded-2xl border border-slate-700 bg-slate-900/60 p-8 shadow-sm">
      <div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-3">
        <div>
          <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-100">18+</div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-400">
  Years of software engineering experience
</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-100">7TB+</div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-400">
  Enterprise content migrated
</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-100">GCC</div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-400">
  Enterprise delivery across GCC
</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>